  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes, the status of an Online Friend in-game claims they're in a private world, when they aren't. You are unable to join them, even if their status is blue. Invites and invite requests do not go through. And when an invite is successfully sent, it sends the user to the VRChat Home of the inviter; where they currently aren't. This mostly happens after VRChat crashes on the Oculus Quest 2, which happens very often. Often enough that you can't go through a session without at least one crash.",
